<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<TcPlcObject Version="1.1.0.1">
  <Itf Name="IModeProvider" Id="{d5a66bed-65be-4c03-b9e1-41ea1857d239}">
    <Declaration><![CDATA[(*
## short summary

This interface defines method for a mode behaviour provider. 
It can be used to inject custom modes into the HMI class.  

legal notes
=================
| SPDX-FileCopyrightText: © 2024 ekvip automation GmbH <info@ekvip.de>
