| For details check: Apache-2.0_

.. _Apache-2.0: https://www.apache.org/licenses/LICENSE-2.0

.. </legal notes>  

*)

INTERFACE IModeProvider EXTENDS CNM_AbstractObject.IObject
]]></Declaration>
    <Method Name="getMode" Id="{c012462e-1147-429a-b6c6-37ef2e12173d}">
      <Declaration><![CDATA[(*
## short summary

A method that returns an interface to an instance of a mode behaviour.
It can be used to trabnslate the operation mode enum to a mode delegate. Overwrite this method for custom modes.

legal notes
=================
| SPDX-FileCopyrightText: © 2024 ekvip automation GmbH <info@ekvip.de>
| SPDX-License-Identifier: Apache-2.0
| For details check: Apache-2.0_

.. _Apache-2.0: https://www.apache.org/licenses/LICENSE-2.0

.. </legal notes>  

*)

METHOD getMode : IModeBehaviour
VAR_INPUT
	mode :UDINT;
END_VAR]]></Declaration>
    </Method>
    <Property Name="mode" Id="{ea939fef-f84d-4aec-bbfc-f6e33ed9d62a}">
      <Declaration><![CDATA[(*
## short summary

This property returns an IModeSelect that offers properties for the mandatory modes.
The modes are accessable via fluent interface, e.g. myModeFactory.mode.automaticMode.

legal notes
=================
| SPDX-FileCopyrightText: © 2024 ekvip automation GmbH <info@ekvip.de>
| SPDX-License-Identifier: Apache-2.0
| For details check: Apache-2.0_

.. _Apache-2.0: https://www.apache.org/licenses/LICENSE-2.0

.. </legal notes>  

*)

PROPERTY mode : IModeSelect]]></Declaration>
      <Get Name="Get" Id="{d157ca2b-5234-4ca8-bc56-60651276f0cf}">
        <Declaration><![CDATA[]]></Declaration>
      </Get>
    </Property>
  </Itf>
</TcPlcObject>